<title>USA: U.S. Apr factory orders rose 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Apr factory orders rose 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce seasonally adjusted data on U.S. factory orders, shipments and unfilled orders.</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Apr--(Prev)	Mar--(Prev)     Feb</p>
<p> New Orders		  1.2		 -1.3   -1.6	0.4</p>
<p> -Ex-Transportation	0.9		 -1.0   -1.2	1.5</p>
<p> -Ex-Defense		 0.8		 -1.1   -1.4	0.6</p>
<p> NonDurables		 1.0		 -0.3   -0.3     -0.4</p>
<p> Durables		    1.3    1.4	-2.2   -2.2	1.0</p>
<p> NonDefense Cap	   -2.0   -1.3	-3.0   -2.9	2.4</p>
<p> -Ex-Aircraft, Parts    -1.6   -0.6	-0.9   -0.9	7.2</p>
<p> -Defense Cap	     27.8   28.0     -12.2  -12.2    -11.1</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Apr--(Prev)	Mar--(Prev)     Feb</p>
<p> Durables NonDefense     0.6    0.6	-1.9   -1.9	1.4</p>
<p> Unfilled-Total	   -0.3		 -0.3   -0.4	0.6</p>
<p> Unfilled-Durables	-0.4   -0.4	-0.4   -0.4	0.7</p>
<p> SHIPMENTS-PCT CHANGES:  Apr--(Prev)	Mar--(Prev)     Feb</p>
<p>  Total			1.2		  0.1   -0.1	0.9</p>
<p>  Durables		   1.2    1.1	 1.0    0.9	2.0</p>
<p> ORDERS-BLNS OF DLRS:   Apr---(Prev)     Mar---(Prev)     Feb</p>
<p>  New Orders	    323.87	     320.06  319.21   324.37</p>
<p>  -Ex-Transportation  284.92	     282.39  281.80   285.16</p>
<p>  -Ex-Defense	   317.69	     315.23  314.45   318.86</p>
<p> ORDERS-BLNS OF DLRS:   Apr---(Prev)     Mar---(Prev)     Feb</p>
<p>  NonDurables	   148.36	     146.84  146.78   147.29</p>
<p>  Durables		175.51  175.56   173.22  173.19   177.08</p>
<p>  NonDef. Cap	    44.62   44.95    45.53   45.53    46.91</p>
<p>  -Ex-Aircraft,Parts   39.59   40.03    40.24   40.25    40.61</p>
<p>  Defense Cap	     6.18    6.19     4.84    4.84     5.51</p>
<p>  DurablesNonDefense  169.33  169.36   168.39  168.35   171.56</p>
<p>  Unfilled-Total	518.58	     520.34  520.12   522.06</p>
<p>  Unfilled-Durables   493.19  493.38   495.13  495.13   497.31</p>
